# SDK Export Surface

- src/index.ts is the public API entrypoint
- Keep runtime exports deliberate, type-only exports explicit
- LibQC default export retained for backward compatibility
- Before removing/renaming any export: this barrel is the contract consumed by quantum-vault. Removal or rename = breaking change requiring coordination
- Re-exports from caip and viem are part of consumer ergonomics
- Do not leak deep internal module paths as public contract
